{
    "title": "Life Bible",
    "description": "Join the millions of people who love the Life Bible App (formerly Tecarta Bible). Our mission is to help people get the most out of their Bibles every day. Start every morning with the verse of the day, daily devotional or daily TouchPoint - Bible answers for life\u2019s most important questions. \r\n\r\nWhether you are a beginner or veteran, you can find everything you need to deepen your relationship with God and grow. There are thousands of free Bible reading plans and devotionals if you need some help on what to read in the morning. Already know what you want to study? Select from the collection of Study Bibles and Commentaries to help you go deeper. Or create your own plans.\r\n\r\nNeed help understanding a verse or just simply want to know more? With just one tap, find the meaning behind every Bible verse (Explain) or see the verse in other Bible translations (Compare). Easily share with your friends.\r\n\r\nSTUDY GOD\u2019S WORD\r\n\u2219 In this Bible app, stream popular translations for free such as the NLT, NIV, KJV, ESV, CSB, NASB, NKJV, AMP, MESSAGE and many more including Spanish and Chinese translations. Download any title for offline access;\r\n\u2219 Search has never been easier or faster. Other Bible apps search only a single translation. The Life Bible App searches over 40 translations simultaneously to find your Bible verse. Use the filter to select your favorite Bible translations;\r\n\u2219 The only Bible app to have the best-selling TouchPoints series available for free. Discover over 350 topics with engaging questions and Scriptures to find Bible answers for life\u2019s most important questions;\r\n\u2219 Listen to an audio Bible to study God\u2019s Word on the go;\r\n\u2219 Explore and try for free all the best-selling Study Bibles to help you understand the meaning and background of Scripture. Here are some of our favorites:\r\n- Life Application Study Bible\r\n- NIV Study Bible\r\n- KJV Study Bible\r\n- ESV Study Bible\r\n- CSB Study Bible\r\n- MacArthur Study Bible\r\n\u2219 Commentaries include Cornerstone Bible Commentary, Life Application Bible Commentary, Thru the Bible Commentary, Jon Courson\u2019s Application Commentary, Believer\u2019s Bible Commentary, Matthew Henry Concise Commentary and the Preacher\u2019s Commentary.\r\n\r\nDAILY BIBLE PLANS AND DEVOTIONALS\r\n\u2219 Get daily Bible app notifications each morning for the Bible verse of the day and daily devotional;\r\n\u2219 Looking to study a devotional topic? Choose from over 600 topics for your daily reading;\r\n\u2219 Start a Bible reading plan by choosing a One-year Bible, The Bible Recap, Chronological Bible, Psalms, Proverbs, Old Testament, New Testament or create your own plan;\r\n\u2219 The Life Bible App allows you to create free 3, 7, 14 or 30 day devotional plans.\r\n\r\nTHE MOST POWERFUL BIBLE APP\r\n\u2219 Designed by developers and designers who love the Bible;\r\n\u2219 Choose your own unique highlight colors to markup important verses and insights in your Bible app;\r\n\u2219 Create personal study notes in the Bible app with our \u201cverse notes\u201d feature! See your personal insights as you read through the Bible;\r\n\u2219 Easily take notes with our \u201cquick-paste\u201d feature. Flip seamlessly between your Bible and notes so you don\u2019t get left behind during church. Rich text editor allows you to bold, underline, indent or create numbered and bulleted lists;\r\n\u2219 Split the screen so you can see Bibles, Study Bibles, commentaries or personal notes side by side;\r\n\u2219 Backup & sync your Bible app. Access notes, bookmarks, highlights and purchases across all your mobile and web devices for easy access anywhere;\r\n\u2219 Customize your Bible study settings to change font, font size, and light/dark mode;\r\n\u2219 Share verses with family and friends via email, text, Twitter or Facebook.\r\n\r\nCheck out the Life Bible website at https://lifebible.com.\r\n\r\nHave any suggestions (content or features) you would like to see offered in our Bible app? Email us at support@tecarta.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Join the millions of people who love the Life Bible App (formerly Tecarta Bible). Our mission is to help people get the most out of their Bibles every day. Start every morning with the verse of the day, daily devotional or daily TouchPoint - Bible answers for life\u2019s most important questions. <br><br>Whether you are a beginner or veteran, you can find everything you need to deepen your relationship with God and grow. There are thousands of free Bible reading plans and devotionals if you need some help on what to read in the morning. Already know what you want to study? Select from the collection of Study Bibles and Commentaries to help you go deeper. Or create your own plans.<br><br>Need help understanding a verse or just simply want to know more? With just one tap, find the meaning behind every Bible verse (Explain) or see the verse in other Bible translations (Compare). Easily share with your friends.<br><br>STUDY GOD\u2019S WORD<br>\u2219 In this Bible app, stream popular translations for free such as the NLT, NIV, KJV, ESV, CSB, NASB, NKJV, AMP, MESSAGE and many more including Spanish and Chinese translations. Download any title for offline access;<br>\u2219 Search has never been easier or faster. Other Bible apps search only a single translation. The Life Bible App searches over 40 translations simultaneously to find your Bible verse. Use the filter to select your favorite Bible translations;<br>\u2219 The only Bible app to have the best-selling TouchPoints series available for free. Discover over 350 topics with engaging questions and Scriptures to find Bible answers for life\u2019s most important questions;<br>\u2219 Listen to an audio Bible to study God\u2019s Word on the go;<br>\u2219 Explore and try for free all the best-selling Study Bibles to help you understand the meaning and background of Scripture. Here are some of our favorites:<br>- Life Application Study Bible<br>- NIV Study Bible<br>- KJV Study Bible<br>- ESV Study Bible<br>- CSB Study Bible<br>- MacArthur Study Bible<br>\u2219 Commentaries include Cornerstone Bible Commentary, Life Application Bible Commentary, Thru the Bible Commentary, Jon Courson\u2019s Application Commentary, Believer\u2019s Bible Commentary, Matthew Henry Concise Commentary and the Preacher\u2019s Commentary.<br><br>DAILY BIBLE PLANS AND DEVOTIONALS<br>\u2219 Get daily Bible app notifications each morning for the Bible verse of the day and daily devotional;<br>\u2219 Looking to study a devotional topic? Choose from over 600 topics for your daily reading;<br>\u2219 Start a Bible reading plan by choosing a One-year Bible, The Bible Recap, Chronological Bible, Psalms, Proverbs, Old Testament, New Testament or create your own plan;<br>\u2219 The Life Bible App allows you to create free 3, 7, 14 or 30 day devotional plans.<br><br>THE MOST POWERFUL BIBLE APP<br>\u2219 Designed by developers and designers who love the Bible;<br>\u2219 Choose your own unique highlight colors to markup important verses and insights in your Bible app;<br>\u2219 Create personal study notes in the Bible app with our \u201cverse notes\u201d feature! See your personal insights as you read through the Bible;<br>\u2219 Easily take notes with our \u201cquick-paste\u201d feature. Flip seamlessly between your Bible and notes so you don\u2019t get left behind during church. Rich text editor allows you to bold, underline, indent or create numbered and bulleted lists;<br>\u2219 Split the screen so you can see Bibles, Study Bibles, commentaries or personal notes side by side;<br>\u2219 Backup &amp; sync your Bible app. Access notes, bookmarks, highlights and purchases across all your mobile and web devices for easy access anywhere;<br>\u2219 Customize your Bible study settings to change font, font size, and light/dark mode;<br>\u2219 Share verses with family and friends via email, text, Twitter or Facebook.<br><br>Check out the Life Bible website at https://lifebible.com.<br><br>Have any suggestions (content or features) you would like to see offered in our Bible app? Email us at support@tecarta.com",
